    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHANTAL: Might I recommend the Chow Attack? Only $9.99. That comes with a burger, large fries, a slice of apple pie and a Happy Swirl...\nELLA: Happy Swirl! I have absolutely no idea what that could be, but it sure sounds promising.",
      "JANE: You need your treatments, mother.\nELLA: I’ve had it up to here with their treatment. I’ve been there, I’ve done that, it wasn’t pretty.",
      "CHANTAL: You want any special sauces with that burger?\nELLA: Thanks, Chantal, we’re fine.\nCHANTAL: Enjoy!",
      "JANE: Sit down, Will. Let’s think this through.\nLILLIAN: Yoo hoo? Any news? Have you heard anything?",
      "JANE: Nothing. Everything’s fine.\nLILLIAN: But where are they?\nJANE: I have no idea, but Mom seems very... energized. And she sends her love to you, Lillian.\nLILLIAN: Isn’t that sweet..."
    ]
  },
